      "statement": "The committed `src/langsmith/langsmith-platform-openapi.json` is the OpenAPI input for the LangSmith REST API reference, which `src/docs.json` configures under `langsmith/smith-api`; Mintlify generates the endpoint routes at deployment rather than from authored MDX endpoint files.",
