      "statement": "`scripts/process_langsmith_openapi.py` is the owner of the generated platform specification: its default output is `src/langsmith/langsmith-platform-openapi.json`, it writes only when `--write` is supplied, and otherwise prints the processed JSON; `--input` permits a local JSON source and `--output` overrides the destination.",
